  "CRUSTACEANS_DESCRIPTIONS": {
    "Isopod": "Rolls into a little ball when spooked; a cleaning crew on tiny legs.",
    "Blue Crab": "Darts sideways on tiptoe, waving sapphire pincers in the sand.",
    "Lobster": "Claws like armored legends, watch your fingers!",
    "Hermit Crab": "Borrows abandoned shells to create its mobile fortress.",
    "Shrimp": "Zips through the water with see-through speed, never stays still.",
    "Mussel": "Clings tight to rocks and filters flavors from the current.",
    "Oyster": "Mysterious shell, open it for pearls or just salty attitude.",
    "Anemone": "Tentacles sway hypnotically, turning curious fish into guests.",
    "Barnacle": "Attaches to anything and doesn't let go, standing guard on the tide.",
    "Sea Slug": "A sea slug that lives in the ocean and is known for its unique appearance.",
    "Sea Snail": "Glides patiently, wearing its spiral home on its back.",
    "Garden Eel": "Peeks from sandy burrows, swaying in underwater gardens.",
    "Sea Grapes": "Tiny green pearls; sea creatures munch them like candy.",
    "Octopus": "Vanishing act extraordinaire, with eight arms and endless surprises.",
    "Sea Urchin": "A spiky purple mystery nestled in underwater crevices.",
    "Horseshoe Crab": "Ancient survivor with a helmet shell and tail like a sword."
  },
